    "body": "\\(a>1\\) 时 \\(y=a^x\\) 递增，\\(a^s>a^1\\iff s>1\\)；\\(0<a<1\\) 时 \\(y=a^x\\) 递减，\\(a^s>a^1\\iff s<1\\)。"
